---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout title="Terms &amp; Conditions - PasteDownloadApp" description="Terms and Conditions for PasteDownloadApp. Free image downloader tool with client-side processing. Read our terms of service." canonicalUrl="https://pastedownloadapp.com/terms/">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://pastedownloadapp.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Terms & Conditions", "item": "https://pastedownloadapp.com/terms/" }
      ]
    }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Terms & Conditions - PasteDownloadApp",
      "description": "Terms and Conditions for PasteDownloadApp. Free online image downloader tool.",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "PasteDownloadApp"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-6 leading-tight text-balance">
    Terms &amp; Conditions
  </h1>

  <div class="text-body text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:sm:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:leading-tight [&_h3]:text-ink [&_h3]:text-base [&_h3]:sm:text-lg [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:tracking-tight [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:mb-2 [&_h3]:leading-tight [&_a]:text-link [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-2 [&_a]:decoration-link/30 [&_a]:transition-colors [&_a:hover]:decoration-link">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 2026</p>

    <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing or using PasteDownloadApp (&ldquo;the Service&rdquo;), you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should not use the Service.
    </p>

    <h2>Description of Service</h2>
    <p>
      PasteDownloadApp is a free online tool that allows users to paste images from their clipboard or fetch images from URLs, preview them, and download them in various formats. All image processing is performed <strong>entirely within your browser</strong> using client-side APIs. No images are uploaded to or processed on our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p>You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms. You must not:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
      <li>Use the Service to download copyrighted images without the owner&rsquo;s permission.</li>
      <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or compromise the Service.</li>
      <li>Use automated scripts, bots, or scrapers to access the Service.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      The Service, including its design, layout, and branding, is owned by PasteDownloadApp. Images downloaded through the Service remain the intellectual property of their respective owners. You are responsible for ensuring you have the right to download and use any image obtained through the Service.
    </p>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The Service is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; without any warranties, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or secure. We are not responsible for any loss, damage, or inconvenience arising from your use of the Service.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, PasteDownloadApp shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of the Service.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about these terms, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@pastedownloadapp.com">hello@pastedownloadapp.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
